# omarchy-m5: USB4/Thunderbolt stage fragment (J716s, T6050). NOT for the
# default build. Merge only together with the T6050 router/combo-PHY/PCIe-C
# code imported from aurora-silicon/linux j716c/thunderbolt and a separate
# t6050-j716s-tb.dtb that describes the RIGHT port (ATC2) only. On the
# current tree these symbols bind to nothing (no T6050 match, no enabled DT
# node), so merging them alone is inert.
CONFIG_TYPEC=y
CONFIG_USB4=y
CONFIG_USB4_APPLE_SOC=y
CONFIG_RESET_APPLE_CIO=y
CONFIG_APPLE_TUNABLE=y
CONFIG_PHY_APPLE_ATC=y
CONFIG_PCIE_APPLE=y
# Thunderbolt/USB4 IP networking (XDomain); interoperates with macOS
# Thunderbolt Bridge. Candidate second access path once ATC2 works.
CONFIG_USB4_NET=y
# Leave the ISP off: T6050 ISP is exclave-assigned, no driver match.
# CONFIG_VIDEO_APPLE_ISP is not set
